      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6a03df97cf565b8f740b7b6f|full_name} Hi, it seems like you've posted a support request to the incorrect channel. This Canny board is for bug reports for developers. For isolated issues or customer support visit help.vrchat.com.\n\nFor a conforming bug report:\n\n- Describe the issue\n\n- Include steps to reproduce: 1. 2. 3.\n\n- Expected result:\n\n- Actual result:\n\n- Attach video/screenshots/logs\n\nParticularly, the \"[SettingsManager] Mic activation threshold set to:\" line from the full [output logs](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/9521522810899-Where-do-I-find-my-Output-Logs-and-Crash-Dumps) would be needed with the above information.",
