  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-05-13T02:25:09.634Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat-Team\n\nRecently other players only hear me extremely cut off or not at all.\n\ni tried multiple things:\n\n- rollback nvidia drivers / change drivers\n\n- update windows to latest\n\n- debug vrchat under steam\n\n- switch between Index headset / desktop\n\n- switch between microphones\n\n- manually update sounddrivers (realtek)\n\n- delete all caches / local user profiles\n\n- reset all local settings\n\nI never had this happen before and i ruled out multiple times now that the issue is with my index microphone.\n\ni would love some help or advice.\n\nthanks in advance",
